# TU7, TU8: `=` does not reach into a boxed tuple either.
== SOURCE
(e_nclose (1, 2)) = e_nclose (1, 2)
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected an array, found a tuple
 --> -e:1:2
  |
1 | (e_nclose (1, 2)) = e_nclose (1, 2)
  |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: `=` has type (Eq a, Truthy b) => a -> a -> b
